### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### List connections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections

### Create SQLite connection
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-sqlite",
  "dialect": "sqlite",
  "options": {
    "path": "demo.db"
  }
}

### Test connection (replace {{id}})
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/test

### Get full schema
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/schema

### Get policy
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/policy

### Replace policy (whitelist tables/columns/ops)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "require_where_for_update": true,
  "require_where_for_delete": true,
  "max_rows_per_mutation": 100,
  "max_rows_per_query": 500,
  "tables": [
    {
      "table": "tasks",
      "allowed_columns": ["id", "title", "status", "priority", "assignee_id"],
      "denied_columns": [],
      "allow_select": true,
      "allow_insert": true,
      "allow_update": true,
      "allow_delete": false
    },
    {
      "table": "users",
      "denied_columns": [],
      "allow_select": true,
      "allow_insert": false,
      "allow_update": false,
      "allow_delete": false
    }
  ]
}

### Allow all tables from live schema (loose config helper)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/policy/allow-all?allow_delete=false

### Check whether an operation is allowed
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/connections/{{id}}/policy/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "table": "tasks",
  "operation": "delete",
  "columns": ["id"]
}
